                "fallback": "占点不是击败某个目标，而是进入并控制区域。先让 A 点完成占领，再继续寻找下一处战区。"
            }
        }
    ],
    "action": {
        "label": {
            "translate": "djzc777.dialog.common.dismiss",
            "fallback": "继续占领",
            "color": "green"
        },
        "action": {
            "type": "run_command",
            "command": "dialog clear @s"
        }
    }
